 "discovery_notes": "Follow-up 3 of B013 (packets 213, 420, 462). Search snippets only; 33 standard searches (3 over 30 budget). dein-dlrp Oct body text resolves NBC conflict (4 OE with per-pin prices, 2 LE 700). dein-dlrp Jun shows 16.99 LE 700 was Ariel/Triton, not Marvel. New: Stitch Autumn 2018 LE 700, Minnie castle/Eiffel BWR pin. Copper mini gains official listing (release 462 hold). RVG 2018 trio LE 500 3 Aug (designs unnamed). Cherry Blossom trio 14 Jul (designs unnamed). passiondlp My Cat PDF suggests Jan-Mar 2018 My Cat pins. Holds retained: Fun Adventures, Ursula BTM, Bambi Flower, Pirates & Princesses, PTN Jan/Mar/Jul/Aug trios, Tod, Marvel poster and trio."
}